            {
              "text": "In the card game, the King is represented by the rank '十三'.",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "He drew the 'King' card, which in this deck is numbered 十三.",
              "citation": {
